  "title": "Metropolitan Commercial Bank Recognized as a Member of Piper Sandler’s Sm-All Stars Class of 2024",
  "summary": "The Prestigious Award Highlights the Bank’s Commitment to Excellence and Innovation Metropolitan Bank Holding Corp. (the “Company”) (NYSE: MCB), the holding company for Metropolitan Commercial Bank is pleased to announce its recognition as a member of Piper Sandler’s Sm-All Stars Class of 2024. This year’s class admits 8 new members and welcomes back 22 alumni. […] The post Metropolitan Commercial Bank Recognized as a Member of Piper Sandler’s Sm-All Stars Class of 2024 appeared first on Metropolitan Commercial Bank .",
